     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Register 0 is the channel status: bit 0 keys the channel, bit 1 selects PCM or waveform, bit 2 the repeat flag and bit 7 the divider.",
